er the next four weeks for a lower price. The screen includes buttons labeled 'Track' and 'View Flights', and a search field to find new dates for comparison. The active tab on the screen is titled 'Track', and there are other tabs titled 'Search' and 'Flights.'","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/7a0d563c16ee37610e81485029b35707/machine-learning-confidence%402x.png","line":274,"embedded":true},{"title":"attribution","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/machine-learning#Attribution","line":278},{"title":"critical or complementary","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/machine-learning#Critical-or-complementary","line":278},{"title":"Attribution","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/machine-learning#Attribution","line":292},{"title":"An illustration of a screen on iPhone, which shows an area that contains recommended videos. The area is labeled 'For You' and includes a row of two video icons. A third video icon is partially visible on the right side of the screen, hinting at additional recommendations.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/published/e071666dc22644640278e74736950868/machine-learning-attribution%402x.png","line":296,"embedded":true},{"title":"mistakes","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/machine-learning#Mistakes","line":302},{"title":"multiple options","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/machine-learning#Multiple-options","line":311},{"title":"Limitations","target":"https://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/machine-learning#Limitations","line":319},{"title":"A screenshot of the Memoji recording sheet on iPhone. The app shows a person's Memoji, above a message that reads 'Low light', which helps convey that additional light is required for a high-quality recording.","target":"https://docs-assets.developer.apple.com/publish